<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ILLOVO SUGAR YR SHR JUMPS, DIV UP.</title>
<headline>ILLOVO SUGAR YR SHR JUMPS, DIV UP.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   80.9	  vs    57.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 32.0	  vs    23.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	  153.25	 vs    95.54</p>
<p>    Headline earnings    128.47	 vs    90.95</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  207.96	 vs   153.97</p>
<p>    Tax			 54.71	 vs    58.43</p>
<p>    Net financing costs   22.23	 vs    28.81</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,764.29	 vs 1,574.81</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	  22.51	 vs     3.19</p>
<p>Div payable: Dec 7</p>
<p>on register: Jan 10 1997</p>
<p>Full name: Illovo Sugar Ltd (food)</p>
<p>NOTE: Directors said the abnormal profit arose from the sale</p>
<p>of cane farms and certain lands which are not under cane.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
